---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hyperlinking Policy - JKSPDC Portal" 
  description="Hyperlinking Policy regarding linking to external government portals and third-party websites linking to JKSPDC."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="text-xs text-slate-500" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="text-slate-400">Policies</span></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">Hyperlinking Policy</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0B4F9C]">Hyperlinking Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-650 mt-1">Rules regarding outbound links to external portals and incoming links to the JKSPDC web portal.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Main Content Area -->
      <main class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Links to External Websites / Portals</h2>
          <p>
            At many places in this portal, you will find links to other government or official websites/portals (such as <a href="https://jktenders.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#0B4F9C] font-semibold underline">jktenders.gov.in</a>, <a href="https://india.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#0B4F9C] font-semibold underline">india.gov.in</a>, and <a href="https://jk.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#0B4F9C] font-semibold underline">jk.gov.in</a>). These links have been placed for convenience and reference.
          </p>
          <p>
            JKSPDCL is not responsible for the contents and reliability of the linked websites and does not necessarily endorse the views expressed in them. We cannot guarantee that these links will work all the time and we have no control over the availability of linked pages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Links to JKSPDC Website by Other Websites</h2>
          <p>
            Prior permission is required before hyperlinking to this portal from any site. Permission for the same, stating the nature of the content on the pages from where the link has to be given and the exact language of the hyperlink, should be obtained by sending a formal request to:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-4 rounded-lg text-xs space-y-1">
            <p class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Managing Director / Web Information Manager</p>
            <p>JKSPDC Corporate Office, Jahangir Chowk, Srinagar — 190009</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] font-semibold underline">md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Policy Navigation</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
            <li><a href="/policies/accessibility" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Accessibility Statement</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/privacy" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/terms" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Terms of Use</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/copyright" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Copyright Policy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
